==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|orv|имѧ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*jьmę}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*inˀmen}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*h₁nómn̥}}.

Cognates include {{cog|en|name}} and {{m|en|noun}}, {{cog|prg|emmens}}, {{cog|sa|नामन्}}, {{cog|fa|نام|tr=nâm}}, {{cog|grc|ὄνομα}}, {{cog|la|nōmen}}

